# Guard film (docs/BUGS.md 56, the user's report 2026-10-18): off a ridge one block wide, head first down its side, then
# along its foot: the body walks straight out until it is flat on the floor, and only then turns (it once turned at once
# and slid sideways with the abdomen still up the wall).
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
cmd fill -6 -60 0 0 -60 0 stone
lens 30
walker worker_ant -4.5 -59 0.5 -90
log down_turn
cmd tick freeze
fov 12
follow 0 2.2 -1.6 0 55
go 3 -60 2
burst down_turn 130 1
log off
follow off
quit
